{"repositoryId":111704445,"availability":"available","full":"marceluda/marceluda.github.io","name":"marceluda.github.io","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2017-11-22T15:56:40Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:54:27Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"http://deanattali.com/beautiful-jekyll","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:20.756Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:20.756Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:20.756Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:02:20.756Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Beautiful Jekyll is a ready-to-use template to help you create an awesome website quickly. Perfect for personal blogs or simple project websites. Check out a demo of what you'll get after just two minutes. You can also look at my personal website to see it in use, or see examples of websites other people created using this theme here.","If you enjoy this theme, please consider supporting me for developing and maintaining this template."],"features":["Beautiful Jekyll is designed to look great on both large-screen and small-screen (mobile) devices. Load up your site on your phone or your gigantic iMac, and the site will work well on both, though it will look slightly…","Many personalization settings in config.yml, such as setting your name and site's description, changing the background colour/image, setting your avatar to add a little image in the navigation bar, customizing the links…","If you want to enable comments on your site, Beautiful Jekyll supports the Disqus comments plugin. To use it, simply sign up to Disqus and add your Disqus shortname to the disqus parameter in the config.yml.","If the disqus parameter is set in the configuration file, then all blog posts will have comments turned on by default. To turn off comments on a particular blog post, add comments: false to the YAML front matter. If you…","Beautiful Jekyll lets you easily add Google Analytics to all your pages. This will let you track all sorts of information about visits to your website, such as how many times each page is viewed and where…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/marceluda/marceluda.github.io/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"794a5bd18ae2d2791a107a1579449e2577c9826601dea537b6cef7cf62dc6946","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:21.125Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:21.125Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Beautiful Jekyll is a ready-to-use template to help you create an awesome website quickly. Perfect for personal blogs or simple project websites. Check out a demo of what you'll get after just two minutes. You can also look at my personal website to see it in use, or see examples of websites other people created using this theme here.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/marceluda/marceluda.github.io/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Beautiful Jekyll is a ready-to-use template to help you create an awesome website quickly. Perfect for personal blogs or simple project websites. Check out a demo of what you'll get after just two minutes. You can also look at my personal website to see it in use, or see examples of websites other people created using this theme here.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/marceluda/marceluda.github.io/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You need to have a GitHub account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/marceluda/marceluda.github.io/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"794a5bd18ae2d2791a107a1579449e2577c9826601dea537b6cef7cf62dc6946","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/marceluda/marceluda.github.io/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:21.126Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T14:54:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/marceluda/marceluda.github.io/blob/master/REA